    "created_at": "2026-03-12T08:50:08Z",
    "updated_at": "2026-03-12T08:50:08Z",
    "body": "Chromium does throw an InvalidStateError stating the OffscreenCanvas has no rendering context.\nAs for the consistency with `transferToImageBitmap` I have no strong feeling, they don't really do the same since `transferToImageBitmap` effectively replaces the canvas bitmap with a new fresh one, while `convertToBlob()`  merely generates a new Blob from the bitmap.  \nAlso, it is consistent with `HTMLCanvasElement.toBlob()`.\n",
    "author_association": "MEMBER",
    "pin": null,
