    "created_at": "2026-03-12T09:58:56Z",
    "updated_at": "2026-03-12T10:02:49Z",
    "body": "Note, though, that specifying \"no context -> transparent bitmap\" makes the context creation a \"write\" operation on the bitmap.\n\n```\nconst canvas = new OffscreenCanvas(77777, 77777);\nconst a = await canvas.convertToBlob(); // returns transparent 70k x 70k\nconst at = wait a.text();\nconst b = await canvas.convertToBlob(); // returns transparent 70k x 70k\nconst bt = b.text();\ncanvas.getContext(\"webgl\");\nconst c = await canvas.convertToBlob(); // returns transparent 16k x 16k, for example\nconst ct = await c.text();\nassert_equals(at, bt);\nassert_equals(at, ct); // fails\n```",
    "author_association": "NONE",
    "pin": null,
